<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Console.log on STEP Batch 12</title><link>https://step-12.github.io/tags/console.log/</link><description>Recent content in Console.log on STEP Batch 12</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en_US</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:23:14 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://step-12.github.io/tags/console.log/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Const, let, if etc</title><link>https://step-12.github.io/posts/intro_js/const_let/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://step-12.github.io/posts/intro_js/const_let/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="from-the-repl-to-the-editor"&gt;From the REPL to the Editor&lt;a class="anchor" href="#from-the-repl-to-the-editor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;So far, you have been programming in the REPL.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;You have typed expressions such as:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ff79c6"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;and:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ff79c6"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ff79c6"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ff79c6"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#bd93f9"&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;JavaScript evaluates them and the REPL shows you the result.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;You have also spent time drawing expression trees.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;You have learned to look at an expression, break it into smaller expressions, and follow the order in which those expressions are evaluated.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Now we are going to change something.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>